id=fold-display
name=DeX Display Control
version=v2.1.0
versionCode=210
author=Ilkygul
description=Resolution and refresh rate for USB-C monitors on Samsung DeX, remembered per monitor, with DeX and apps kept at the monitor's rate. Optional: keep the phone screen off while connected, a lower phone screen refresh rate during DeX, and experimental 4K 75 Hz. Open the page from KernelSU Manager. Root required.
